What is Soy Protein Concentrate?
Soy Protein Concentrate (SPC) is a high-protein derivative of soybeans, containing approximately 65% protein content. It is produced by removing soluble carbohydrates from defatted soy flour, resulting in a product with improved flavor and functional properties compared to traditional soy flour. SPC serves as a versatile ingredient in food processing, particularly in meat analogs, dairy alternatives, and animal feed formulations due to its binding, emulsifying, and water-retention capabilities.

